; Groovy pop in F, 8 channels: 4 pulse, triangle, saw, 2 noise.
; Layers by section (24 bars, loops):
;   intro  1-4    bass, kick, hats; stabs join at bar 3
;   verse  5-12   + clap groove, arps, lead; lead echo joins at bar 9
;   chorus 13-20  all 8: saw line, four-on-the-floor, open hats
;   outro  21-24  thin drums, bass, arps, saw
; Verse/intro/outro chords: Gm7 C7 Fmaj7 Dm7. Chorus: Bb C Am Dm | Bb C F F-C7.
